      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    trials = 200\n    success_probability = 0.05\n    successes = 10\n\n    # Calculate the exact binomial probability and convert it to a percentage\n    from math import comb\n\n    probability = (\n        comb(trials, successes)\n        * (success_probability ** successes)\n        * ((1 - success_probability) ** (trials - successes))\n    )\n    answer = round(probability * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return the answer\n    return answer\n```",
